Original Statement:
------------------
SELECT 
  TPCDS.WEB_SITE.WEB_SITE_SK,
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_DOW 
FROM 
  TPCDS.WEB_SITE 
  INNER JOIN TPCDS.DATE_DIM2 
  ON TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_DATE_SK = TPCDS.WEB_SITE.WEB_CLOSE_DATE_SK 
WHERE 
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_QOY >= 3 AND 
  TPCDS.WEB_SITE.WEB_GMT_OFFSET <= -005.00


Optimized Statement:
-------------------
SELECT 
  Q1.WEB_SITE_SK AS "WEB_SITE_SK",
  Q2.D_DOW AS "D_DOW" 
FROM 
  TPCDS.WEB_SITE AS Q1,
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2 AS Q2 
WHERE 
  (Q2.D_DATE_SK = Q1.WEB_CLOSE_DATE_SK) AND 
  (Q1.WEB_GMT_OFFSET <= -005.00) AND 
  (3 <= Q2.D_QOY)

Explain level:    Explain from section

